// Web search plugin — new capability, not a port.
//
// Prefix "?": typing "?hyprland layer rules" offers to open the search in a
// browser. Contextual search beats switching to a tab and retyping, which is
// why it is included even though rofi had no equivalent.
//
// DuckDuckGo first on purpose: it is the engine that does not need a session
// cookie to give the same results, and it is one Tab away from the others.

Config(
    prefix: "?",
    engines: [DuckDuckGo, Google],
)
